<style>
  .inst-root {
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 560px;
    padding-top: 18px;
    padding-bottom: 18px;
    padding-left: 20px;
    padding-right: 20px;
    gap: 10px;
    background-color: #101726;
    border-color: #4ade80;
    border-width: 2px;
    border-radius: 22px;
  }
  .header-row {
    flex-direction: row;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .heading {
    color: #4ade80;
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .step-card {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    padding-bottom: 10px;
    padding-left: 14px;
    padding-right: 14px;
    background-color: #182338;
    border-color: #2f405f;
    border-width: 1px;
    border-radius: 14px;
  }
  .step-title {
    color: #fde047;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .step-body {
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 19px;
  }
</style>
<Panel class="inst-root">
  <div class="header-row">
    <div class="heading">HOW TO PLAY ROLLOX</div>
    <Button id="inst-back">
      <ButtonIcon><ChevronLeft></ChevronLeft></ButtonIcon>
      <ButtonLabel>Back</ButtonLabel>
    </Button>
  </div>

  <div class="step-card">
    <span class="step-title">1. Pinch &amp; Grab (Hands-First)</span>
    <span class="step-body">Hold your thumb and index finger together on the glowing bowling ball. No controllers required! On desktop mouse, click and hold the ball to drag.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="step-card">
    <span class="step-title">2. Pull Back &amp; Aim Sideways</span>
    <span class="step-body">Pull smoothly toward your body to charge power (up to 24 cm). Move your hand left or right to curve your trajectory line around rails, ramps, and Barnaby the Dwarf.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="step-card">
    <span class="step-title">3. Release to Launch</span>
    <span class="step-body">Open your pinch cleanly to bowl! Pull too gently (under 8% power) and the ball snaps safely back to the tee so accidental taps never waste a shot.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="step-card">
    <span class="step-title">4. Scoring &amp; Workshop</span>
    <span class="step-body">Each pin is worth +10 pts. Clear Shot 1 for STRIKE (+50), Shot 2 for SPARE (+25), or build custom lanes in the Alley Workshop!</span>
  </div>

  <Button id="inst-start-tutorial" style="background-color: #0284c7; justify-content: center;">
    <ButtonIcon><Hand></Hand></ButtonIcon>
    <ButtonLabel>Replay Guided Onboarding</ButtonLabel>
  </Button>
</Panel>
